==English==

===Etymology===
Possibly from [[Basque]] ''[[Jainko]]'', [[God]], or a euphemism for [[Jesus]], used in a propaganda song.

===Pronunciation===
IPA: /ˈdʒɪŋgɘʊɪz(ɘ)m/

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{uncountable}} Excessive [[patriotism]] or [[aggressive]] [[nationalism]] especially with regards to foreign policy.

====Related terms====
*[[jingoist]]
*[[jingoistic]]
*[[jingoistically]]

